// MUGGING_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1199311670" "We're just gonna take what we want!"
// MUGGING_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2543482577" "We can take your money, your life, both, whatever."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3288535779" "We're here to liberate you from your possessions.  And maybe your life."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3708414901" "I need things, you have money, I need your money to get me things."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2371244122" "I could just hurt you because I feel like it."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3274168012" "Let's see how loud I can make you scream!"

// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2421378899" "Why do you protect these weaklings?!"
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3021560374" "They're weak, they deserve what they get!"
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P521076133" "You disgust me!"
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P713788505" "Let's tear this place apart!"
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3318181035" "I'm gonna wipe the floor with you!"
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1671185381" "Ready!  Fire!  Aim!"

// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4035074803" "Don't hurt me!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P914795265" "Someone help me!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1754050724" "No! I have a family!"

// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P4017509048" "Thank you for saving me."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2282192135" "That was some mighty fine fighting!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P4208483108" "Those maniacs think they own the world."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1625170533" "They're freaks!  All of them!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2964729930" "They're totally crazy!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2142900388" "Thank you!  I didn't know what to do!"

// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3129724922" "Don't worry about the pain."
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2951566693" "Heroes never learn!"
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2506057470" "How are you enjoying your last day on Earth?"
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1253855720" "I'm not violent.  I just don't like you very much."
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4250011924" "When all else fails, violence prevails!"

// VANDALISM_VANDAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3260527782" "I'm so wired!"
// VANDALISM_VANDAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1958545739" "I can't stop smashing things!"
// VANDALISM_VANDAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3094316314" "The fetishization of material goods is sickening!"
// VANDALISM_VANDAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1627067352" "I like to smash stuff!"
// VANDALISM_VANDAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2835198786" "It's art!  Smash it again!"

// VANDALISM_VANDAL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1923826192" "I been waitin' for a fight!"
// VANDALISM_VANDAL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2591678039" "Capitalist scum!"
// VANDALISM_VANDAL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2504906723" "You can't beat me, I'm free of everything!"
// VANDALISM_VANDAL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1817250925" "I don't know what your problem is, but I bet it's hard to pronounce!"
// VANDALISM_VANDAL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P667391835" "You don't want to be starting something with me.  I'll bury you!"

// VANDALISM_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3327944425" "Destroy and be free!"
// VANDALISM_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P373479355" "We should set things on fire next!"
// VANDALISM_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P868262104" "This is what freedom is about!"
// VANDALISM_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2330561868" "Now, this is living!"
// VANDALISM_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1261593686" "Put your back into it!"
// VANDALISM_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2474904610" "You got it, man!  Smash it!"
// VANDALISM_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1139244470" "Rage against the machine, man!"

// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3759742739" "You're so weak, maybe I should just break you."
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1299704542" "You're a waste of a life."
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P73243851" "Where you gonna run?"
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2327600580" "Just so you know, I'm going to enjoy this."
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3775826502" "Don't run.  You'll only die tired."
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2952739778" "I just want to hurt you.  Is that so wrong?"
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1159435748" "Why be nice?  Where has it gotten you?"

// HARRASS_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1609433624" "I hope you can fight, hero!"
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1973753282" "I feel no pain."
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4003022101" "Human life is meaningless to me."
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P212335489" "The dumber people think I am, the more surprised they are when I kill them!"
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1160914083" "I'm gonna rip you limb from limb!"
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P781512557" "A ha ha hahahahahahaha!"

// HARRASS_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1635206692" "Just leave me alone!"
// HARRASS_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1690700963" "Please! Take my money and go!"
// HARRASS_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1126644206" "You're scaring me!"
// HARRASS_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1188196617" "Stop it!"
// HARRASS_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1608145907" "What is the matter with you?  I didn't do anything!"

// HARRASS_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1930751714" "Like you can stop us!"
// HARRASS_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1864607895" "We'll make you pay!"
// HARRASS_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1657825329" "Think you're a tough guy, huh?"
// HARRASS_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4014179151" "It's smash time!"

// HARRASS_VICTIM_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1663045777" "Watch out! They're maniacs!"
// HARRASS_VICTIM_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P119919493" "I knew a hero would come!"
// HARRASS_VICTIM_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1930777513" "They would have killed me!"

// HARRASS_POLICE_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3614648877" "Cops. I don't like cops."
// HARRASS_POLICE_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P248339552" "Your laws make me sick"
// HARRASS_POLICE_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P135145456" "All law does is protect the weak."

// HARRASS_POLICE_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3261734141" "Don't mess with me!"
// HARRASS_POLICE_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1207868467" "Smash the state!"
// HARRASS_POLICE_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2340227748" "Tear down the old order!"

// HARRASS_POLICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2983750169" "You have...the right to...remain...silent..."
// HARRASS_POLICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2705456106" "You're...under...arrest..."
// HARRASS_POLICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P289758352" "You won't get away with this!"

// HARRASS_POLICE_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3457970893" "Thanks for helping me."
// HARRASS_POLICE_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2995900026" "If you hadn't come by, I'd be a goner."
// HARRASS_POLICE_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3738235439" "You should join the force!"

// HARRASS_GUARD_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P899294483" "I'm gonna beat you down to nothing."
// HARRASS_GUARD_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P765311882" "Beg for mercy.  It'll make me angrier."
// HARRASS_GUARD_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P378682459" "We'll do this nice and slow."
// HARRASS_GUARD_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1952595342" "I hate all of you guys!"
// HARRASS_GUARD_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P332596317" "I got a real problem with guys in uniform!"

// HARRASS_GUARD_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2002550436" "Don't try to stop me!"
// HARRASS_GUARD_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2486207858" "Smash it all to pieces!"
// HARRASS_GUARD_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1891239801" "You'll be sorry."
// HARRASS_GUARD_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2818322149" "That's an ugly costume!"

// HARRASS_GUARD_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1888731625" "Somebody get help!"
// HARRASS_GUARD_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3454882101" "Sound an alarm!"
// HARRASS_GUARD_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P391572063" "Help! Please, someone! Anyone!"
// HARRASS_GUARD_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1244276805" "You'll never get away with this!"
// HARRASS_GUARD_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3543374921" "Are you insane?  Do you know what you're doing???"

// HARRASS_GUARD_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P146846082" "Thank you.  Don't know how much longer I coulda lasted."
// HARRASS_GUARD_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P583019108" "You saved the day for sure."
// HARRASS_GUARD_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3903293491" "They would have torn me limb from limb!"
// HARRASS_GUARD_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1111783954" "You really saved me back there, thanks."
// HARRASS_GUARD_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2955946616" "I could have turned it around, but...well, thanks."

// HIDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2489975572" "Now, we wait here until we get the signal."
// HIDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3889352586" "We wait here for the contact."
// HIDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1724156264" "Don't worry. They'll come for us."
