"P4175433846" "Beat it!"

// HOTLOOT_LOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3201218759" "We got fine merchandise, freshly looted."
// HOTLOOT_LOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3100862514" "Sweet deals for the morally unburdened."
// HOTLOOT_LOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2650360815" "Get it while it's hot!"
// HOTLOOT_LOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P415398597" "Only the best for Freakshow customers!"
// HOTLOOT_LOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3032115613" "You want it?  We got it!  Right here!"
// HOTLOOT_LOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1497312342" "These speakers go to 11!"

// HOTLOOT_LOOTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1072186942" "Don't interfere!"
// HOTLOOT_LOOTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3566639019" "This is business. Our business."
