// HOTLOOT_LOOTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1032825788" "Let the games begin!"

// BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P465883944" "Hurry up before a mask shows."
// BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4290493819" "The funny thing is, I used to work here."
// BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P670450022" "This is gonna be a sweet score."
// BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P211024619" "You didn't see nuthin'!"
// BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4044952853" "Hey, man, break in...bust some heads, either way, it's all good!"

// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3300796432" "We'd hate to see something nasty happen to you..."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3339627964" "Now your business is our business."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3629297568" "Look, I can protect you, but it's gonna cost."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1234208424" "Hey, you don't HAVE to pay up.  But your store could also mysteriously burn to the ground."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1759055694" "You pay up and no one gets hurt.  Maybe."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P645772211" "I'm a business man, too.  Pay me and I won't wreck the place."

// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1980065002" "You want to be an example, huh?"
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2849206257" "They can't protect what they got, then we take it."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P298104901" "You're gonna wake up in traction."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P534441835" "Are you INSANE?  Do you have any idea the kind of pain you're going to feel now?"
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2025087625" "When they put the word 'stupid' in the dictionary, they used your picture right next to it."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3908085643" "I'm Freakshow.  You think you can take me on?"
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1573618142" "I'll rip your arm off!"

// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1138547106" "I'm not paying you thugs anything!"
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P978643704" "You get out of here, you freaks!"
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3612733467" "I don't want your protection! I just want to be left alone!"
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3694072703" "You can't threaten me!"
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4145583761" "This is...this is not right!  You shouldn't be able to get away with this!"

// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P4172496611" "If you hadn't shown up, I would have been in trouble."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
