// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1872610420" "You're a real inspiration."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P890204797" "Thank you so much!  You've been a great help!"
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2178785763" "Oh thank you!  They were trying to extort me!"

// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
