// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1423840814" "Let's make this a free-for-all!"
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2151128514" "Of course you can join. Let me 'initiate' you!"

// TERRA_VOLTA_ROADBLOCK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3128184044" "Freakshow rules the roads here!"
// TERRA_VOLTA_ROADBLOCK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1068455868" "This is what we call a toll zone."
// TERRA_VOLTA_ROADBLOCK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P752755522" "We call the shots around here!"

// TERRA_VOLTA_ROADBLOCK_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1376345095" "No one and nothing gets by!"
// TERRA_VOLTA_ROADBLOCK_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1449120293" "Terra Volta is ours."
// TERRA_VOLTA_ROADBLOCK_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1201934761" "This is a Freaks only zone."

// RAMPAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2136961327" "Bring it all crashing down!"
// RAMPAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3531536785" "Waste it! Waste it all!"

// RAMPAGE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1705891765" "We're gonna tear this place down!"
// RAMPAGE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1124454558" "Glory of violence!"

// RAMPAGE_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1666590868" "Break it all apart!"
// RAMPAGE_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2142360896" "Rip it up!"
// RAMPAGE_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2932918887" "Tear it down!"
// RAMPAGE_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1837916704" "Pound it into gravel!"

// RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3843688531" "I feel no pain!"
// RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P10464092" "You're gonna have to do better than that!"

// RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3592570096" "I'll make you feel pain!"
// RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1806519476" "RUUUUMBLE!!!!!!!"
// RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2812751874" "Violence is all that matters!"

// GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3851194261" "You won't get past us!"
// GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P264197658" "We'll defend our territory to our last breath!"
// GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2460275223" "For the Freakshow!"

// FREAKSHOW_EXAMINE_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P1059606345" "We should be able to do some damage with this stuff."
// FREAKSHOW_EXAMINE_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P2397409482" "How much chaos do you think we can cause?"
// FREAKSHOW_EXAMINE_GENERIC_TEXT :
"P3071177506" "I've got a nasty plan for this stuff!"

// FREAKSHOW_EXAMINE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3419727270" "Good! I've been itching for a fight!"
// FREAKSHOW_EXAMINE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3451484124" "Bring in the violence, bring in the pain!"
// FREAKSHOW_EXAMINE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1236740338" "Let's get it on!"

// FREAKSHOW_JUNKDRONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1979752157" "Perfect. These parts will do the job."
// FREAKSHOW_JUNKDRONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P395496885" "All right! Spare parts!"
// FREAKSHOW_JUNKDRONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2377968945" "I can use a lot of this junk."

// FREAKSHOW_JUNKDRONE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3009785768" "A beatdown sounds like good fun!"
// FREAKSHOW_JUNKDRONE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2759693189" "Ready to see some stars?"
// FREAKSHOW_JUNKDRONE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3467205413" "When I'm through, you won't recognize yourself!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3125117298" "Well well well.  This could be promising."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2621454831" "One man's trash, another man's treasure, I always say."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P762763355" "Heh heh heh.  Oh, now this is good stuff."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1243975324" "I see chaos and pandemonium with this stuff.  Ohhh yeah."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P208070628" "This looks like it could be useful.  I can do a lot of damage with this stuff."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4016530700" "Man, this place is a virtual GOLDMINE!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4052674078" "Wow!  All this loot!  Does it GET any better than this?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1591315862" "I can seriously hurt some people with this."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3030114717" "This is MINE!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1661025112" "You can't have any of this!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1658046755" "I'll rip your arms off before I let you take any of this stuff away.  Wait, that sounds like fun.  Come here!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2910847941" "I'm going to rip you limb from limb!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_KNEELING_INVESTIGATOR_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2548226667" "I'm going to make your death wish come true!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1872640448" "I love this place already.  Stuff.  Carnage.  People to harass.  Does it get any better?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2758511660" "Man, this place is cool.  Why didn't we take advantage of this earlier?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2320479481" "So, the day is young and we're prime for chaos.  Where to begin?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2369815435" "I love the air of chaos, don't you?  Today is ripe for mayhem."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1986696292" "Okay, so we'll undo all the work those construction crews did yesterday.  But first, I want a donut."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4041130791" "Sure we'll deal with Arachnos.  We're just gonna steal it back anyway."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2365813188" "The great thing about being Freakshow is you never gotta keep your word."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3265594341" "Let 'em think we're insane.  They underestimate us.  That never hurts."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3970522068" "Lord Refuse doesn't scare me.  I can hand his cape to him any day of the week.  Arachnos got some nerve trying to scare us into cutting them deals."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1002238664" "Whatever.  We can deal with Arachnos.  They're just little spiders that we can squash at any time."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1394271525" "It sucks that gotta deal with those wolf spider guys.  I'd rather talk to those hot widows instead."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P463777254" "Arachnos doesn't like us moving in on their action.  I can respect that.  I ain't gonna back down.  But I can respect it."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3552774721" "The fun came to us!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1697839740" "Hey, look, we didn't have to walk far for some mayhem!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2578769205" "Hey, let's play, hero!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P353080799" "I see opportunity for destruction!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3409755796" "Let's break some limbs!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P308460292" "Heh heh heh."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3937910884" "Oh yeah."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P402397016" "Right on."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P301317562" "You got it, man."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3266145616" "Sounds good to me."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P490990381" "Where do we start?"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1419144894" "Now THIS is going to be cool."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P951009590" "So even if something goes wrong and I lose an arm or leg or something, this is still going to be cool!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3162910952" "Red wires, blue wires, whatever."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2120415988" "How much damage do you think I can do to myself if I mess this up?"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P670384918" "Got company, man."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2609154820" "Not alone, man."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2258354676" "We got company!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_FREAKSHOW_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4081023449" "Let's create some mischief because we're not alone!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PLOT_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2608689920" "Okay, it's like this.  Overflow, we got this place.  First we..."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PLOT_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P781444199" "This is a PLOT session.  You paying attention?  I don't want to have to repeat myself here."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PLOT_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4185641835" "Okay, here's how it goes.  I give my dastardly plot ideas and you all go, 'oooo' and 'ahhhh'."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PLOT_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1468221234" "Quiet.  I'm formulating a plan of mischief."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PLOT_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P942078887" "Okay, here's how we're gonna do it.  First we smash some stuff, then we beat some heads, then we smash some more stuff.  Sound like a plan?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PLOT_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P868495928" "Yes we're dealing with Arachnos.  Then we're stealing back the stuff and crackin' some heads.  Any questions?"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PLOT_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1353860821" "Alright, guys!  Let's put the plan into action!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PLOT_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3647550154" "Skull-smashin time!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PLOT_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3694183072" "Time to break some bones!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PLOT_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4083564014" "Let's do it!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SCAVENGE_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P674202614" "Deeper.  There's gotta be some good stuff down here if Arachnos is so bent on us not getting it."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SCAVENGE_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3051345" "Put your back into it!  This is pay dirt!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SCAVENGE_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P246870121" "I don't know what's in here, but if Arachnos is so determined to keep us out of it, I want it."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SCAVENGE_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1106522220" "Whatever's down there, we'll find a use for it."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SCAVENGE_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1525785242" "You're not gettin' ANY of this action, loser!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SCAVENGE_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1162704557" "You gotta be kiddin' me!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SCAVENGE_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1140895261" "Oh, I don't think so!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SCAVENGE_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2322477086" "I'm gonna use this to rearrange your face!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SCAVENGE_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3038547842" "You lose!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P130314039" "Just grab whatever.  We get caught, we get caught.  We'll beat our way out of it."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1532904188" "What?  You got a better plan?  Just grab stuff, for sobbing out loud."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3545027745" "Okay, so we get caught.  I'm not seeing a downside here.  Hello!  Opportunity to beat some heads!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2766329736" "Okay, so here's the deal.  You pick it up.  You take it away.  You don't pay for it.  If anyone bugs you.  You hurt them.  Got that?"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P139418652" "Plan B!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1990563002" "Skull crackin' time!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P545451225" "I'd just like to take a moment to let you know that it's going to be my pleasure to beat the snot out of you!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P641548673" "Come here!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2880015701" "Over here, goodie two-shoes!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2575401381" "Got it."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1593671688" "Sounds like a plan."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1365883842" "Good deal."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P819828649" "I'm with you."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1322675428" "I'm down with that."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1985559739" "Sure."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3596664085" "I'm all over that."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2386834019" "Oh yeah, he's the best.  He could pick locks in his sleep."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P580413230" "Oh he's good.  He's got the fingers of a pianist."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2492996108" "Well, of course he's using a hammer.  He's finessing it Freakshow-style."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2493644109" "Yeah, I should probably be quiet.  You know...stealthy stealing and all that.  But really.  Could be fun if we get caught by some Paragon Police."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P747422929" "Bad idea!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P714091298" "Beat it, punk!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1938822077" "I'm gonna crush you!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2238168324" "What are YOU lookin' at?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3769471854" "Problems?"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3249168753" "Heard that."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3145403566" "I tried to pick locks once.  It didn't take.  I just slam my shoulder into doors now.  Same result."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2220402737" "We gonna be here much longer?  I'm gettin' kinda tired."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1865630803" "Think we should help?  Nah."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREAKSHOWLOST_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3410348445" "TELL me that isn't all you've got!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREAKSHOWLOST_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2304800804" "My grandmother hits harder than that!  Come ON!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREAKSHOWLOST_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2275872969" "Are you SERIOUS????  You call that an attack?   I sneeze harder than that!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREAKSHOWLOST_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1609330223" "I'm in danger of catching a cold from all that wind you're blowing in my direction!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHOVE_FREAKSHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2687971668" "Oooo.  Mid-transformation, huh?  Looks like it hurts.  How's the shoulder?  Am I shoving too hard?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHOVE_FREAKSHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2831911719" "Looks like you're on the wrong side of the water, pal.  I'd rearrange your face, but it looks like that's already started."
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHOVE_FREAKSHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2610788807" "Dang, you ugly.  You sure this is part of your 'transformation'?  Or did you just lose a fight with a moving truck?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHOVE_FREAKSHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2301733625" "Ooo...  That transformation looks painful.  This shoving hurt much?  How about this?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHOVE_FREAKSHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2973404002" "It takes some guts to stray from your territory.  Too bad I'm gonna have to spill 'em now."

// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHOVE_FREAKSHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P569334128" "Oh yeah?  You think so?  Looks like I'll be 'transforming' you now!  Into a blood heap!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHOVE_FREAKSHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P95340618" "Why you gotta get all in our business, huh?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHOVE_FREAKSHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P825415778" "Ew.  I'd rearrange your face, too, goody two-shoes, but it looks like someone beat me to it.  Ah, I'll hurt ya anyway."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_FIXER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1771341193" "I don't know what this is, but it's cool."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_FIXER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1994460432" "I can use this.  It's cool."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_FIXER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1700887802" "I'm makin' art."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_FIXER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2052740134" "It doesn't shoot or nothin' so maybe I can use it for an art piece."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_FIXER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3016885949" "I just found this!  You're not gettin' it!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_FIXER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3451798682" "Get your own stuff!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P624227058" "What's that?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1958508440" "Whatcha doing with that thing?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4287153800" "That's cool."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3449325312" "Man, that's shiny.  I dig it."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2541853924" "Get your own!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P142216616" "Problem?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RATCHETFIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2753353934" "Beat it, geek!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1958094379" "If anything comes near me, I break its arm and take it home for a trophy."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3253078993" "I hope some Lost wander in here soon.  I feel like busting them up some more."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3674092352" "It's a nice day for some skull crushing, don't you think?  Let's start with some heroes.  Seen any yet?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2293709372" "Anything that gets past me will start in one piece and end in two."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3273312796" "You look like a good prospect for some bone crunching."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P755490001" "I hate goody goodies.  I especially hate you."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3930026337" "I'm gonna rip your arms off and feed them to you!  No wait, I think I'll keep 'em."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1578374193" "I barely moved."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2605437757" "I moved a smidge.  Come ON."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4025004049" "Whatever, man.  Pain's cool."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2201254199" "Are you trying to spot weld my arm to my hip?"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1003957237" "Art later!  Time for busting some heads!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2769388972" "I see victim potential."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P989761909" "We'll finish this up later.  We got some skulls to crack!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_WELDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2788886806" "Man, I'm tellin' ya, you keep moving and I'm going to weld that to your eye."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_WELDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2216794175" "What part of 'don't move' do you not understand?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_WELDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P660888762" "This is intricate work, you know that right?  You moving around like a wiggly schoolgirl is doesn't help."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_WELDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2785258859" "You know I have this tool here that burns stuff real bad right?  Okay, so maybe you wanna stop moving around?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_WELDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1821435635" "I can't believe you're doing that while getting torched."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_WELDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1509929591" "Great!  You made me mess up!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_WELDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P806927010" "I wasn't done!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_WELDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3037685279" "Always with the interruptions!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_WELDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2776247835" "Art takes time!!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3161270194" "This newspaper is flammable.  It burns, man.  Watch it, will ya?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1466027433" "Great.  You talked to me and now I lost my place."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P513615157" "You almost torched the Funny Pages!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P878062969" "I didn't move.  I barely turned the page."


// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_KNEELING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1695694312" "I'm barely breathing let alone moving.  You're gonna get all sarcastic on me now?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_KNEELING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P824654555" "Oh quit your whining.  I'm kneeling here like a statue."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_KNEELING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1581046250" "You might wanna hurry it up a bit.  My legs just fell asleep."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_KNEELING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1986983351" "How's it look?"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_DRINKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3276603997" "You almost made me spill my coffee!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_DRINKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3447753466" "Man, you gotta watch what you're doing!  You almost melted my cup!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_DRINKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1261890743" "Tryin' to drink here.  Can you weld more carefully?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_DRINKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2641108023" "Hey, cool.  You warmed up my coffee."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_WELDPAL_VICTIM_DRINKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P342475807" "You warmed up my coffee.  Sweet.  Rats.  It's spot-welded to my hand."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_ARTIST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4001334798" "I still got it."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_ARTIST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3090117616" "Not anyone can create art like this, you know."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_ARTIST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3017863957" "Man, I am a genius and a half!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_ARTIST_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3109700300" "Aw man, why you gotta interrupt me like that?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_ARTIST_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2695124691" "Great, now it's not perfect!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_ARTIST_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1914659398" "You made me move out of the lines!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_ARTIST_ALERT_TEXT :
"P731869918" "Oh great.  Just  great, now I gotta fix it!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1130906110" "That's cool, man."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1214305197" "You take classes?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2773178594" "Sweet."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1172819475" "Looks good, man."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2260895392" "You interrupted the master!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1927113376" "You made him mess it up!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3923504049" "Oh nice going, ace!  Now you're gonna pay!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SOLOLEDGESIT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P517211785" "I'm gonna squash you like a squishy squashed bug!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SOLOLEDGESIT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P376425633" "I got time to beat ya up."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_SOLOLEDGESIT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2893848922" "I'm gonna bust you up, just because I wanna bust you up."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_JACKHAMMER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2325806379" "Hey!  I was workin' here!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_JACKHAMMER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P104505233" "Pretty dumb interrupting a guy with a JACKHAMMER in his hand."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_JACKHAMMER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3311988757" "Wow, you really do have a death wish!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1045299129" "Let's just walk around until we see something to attack."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3703959513" "See anything to attack yet?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1547448130" "I wanna attack something.  How much longer we gotta walk until I can beat something to a pulp?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3858032093" "Less walking, more damage."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3489027491" "Sweet!  The fight came to us!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P431568181" "Heads are gonna roll!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1308364881" "I'll be nice.  I'll just use one arm to fight you."

// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_FREAK_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1580851072" "Hey, all I'm sayin' is maybe we can use it and maybe we can't.  If you want it, you're gonna have to make it worth my while."
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_FREAK_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4120991532" "Now's the time to impress me with a spectacular offer."
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_FREAK_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3633117384" "Underneath all this metal, I'm a businessman.  Now do right by me."
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_FREAK_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P256620229" "Look, I got interests here, too, so if you want the stuff we've pulled from those wrecked bases, you better start doin' right by me."

// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_FREAK_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3088288673" "Kill 'em!  I got a rep to protect!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_FREAK_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4023009416" "You didn't see that!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_FREAK_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3118459646" "You got too curious, goody two-shoes!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_ARACHNOS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1017407387" "Well, I won't be extorted by some metallic psychopath in makeup.  If you think those strong-arm tactics are going to work, think again.  Do you even KNOW who Lord Recluse is?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_ARACHNOS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2346347551" "I can see I'm speaking above you here.  Let's try something a little simpler:  me give you good price.  Ok?"

// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_ARACHNOS_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P438673119" "No witnesses!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_ARACHNOS_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2447722937" "Do what you do best, Freakshow!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERBROOK_SHADYDEAL_ARACHNOS_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P131030525" "We can't afford to be seen together!"

// BRICKSTOWN_ZE_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
