// BRICKSTOWN_FS_RUMBLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4106169407" "You haven't tasted true pain!"
// BRICKSTOWN_FS_RUMBLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2468265363" "I've been itching for a good fight! You better not disappoint!"
// BRICKSTOWN_FS_RUMBLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P25400740" "Bring in the violence, bring in the PAIN!"

// BRICKSTOWN_FS_RUMBLE_ALERTED_TEXT :
