"P2710216450" "SMAAAAAASH!!!"

// BRICKSTOWN_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3017414961" "Your days of terrorizing this town are over, Freaks!"
// BRICKSTOWN_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
