// BRICKSTOWN_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1806134414" "This is your final warning, Freakshow. Drop your weapons or we'll open fire."
// BRICKSTOWN_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P376313728" "Lay down your weapons. Slowly."
// BRICKSTOWN_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P729008261" "Up against the wall, Freakshow."
// BRICKSTOWN_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P596654504" "You're coming with us, Freakshow."
// BRICKSTOWN_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1067617190" "If you do not comply we will have no choice but to open fire."
// BRICKSTOWN_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3558499026" "Come pepeaceably, Freakshow."
// BRICKSTOWN_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P810989657" "Party's over, Freakshow."

// BRICKSTOWN_FS_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2138495677" "Heya little pigs, I'm the big bad wolf! Imma your worst nightmare!"
// BRICKSTOWN_FS_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
