// BRICKSTOWN_FS_RUMBLE_PPD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1582428720" "Go ahead and shoot! I'll feed on the pain!"

// BRICKSTOWN_FS_RUMBLE_PPD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1034531533" "I want to hear bones snap!"

// BRICKSTOWN_SHAKEDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1993532354" "Nice head. I think I'll take it!"
// BRICKSTOWN_SHAKEDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3367115337" "Ah, the fruits of violence!"
// BRICKSTOWN_SHAKEDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P211442234" "We're the kings of the coming future, baby!"

// BRICKSTOWN_SHAKEDOWN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4039890850" "Now it's a party!"
// BRICKSTOWN_SHAKEDOWN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1591503767" "Get lost, woman!<em>I got me a hero to beat!"
// BRICKSTOWN_SHAKEDOWN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4284909829" "Beat it, princess!<em>I gots me a hero to smash!"

// BRICKSTOWN_LOITER_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1717565993" "Did I tell you I'm making a mix tape of screams?"
// BRICKSTOWN_LOITER_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1108411495" "So I caved his face in cuz he said not to hurt him. HA!"
// BRICKSTOWN_LOITER_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1364607885" "Now's our time to shine! Let's get out there and take this town!"
// BRICKSTOWN_LOITER_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
