// BRICKSTOWN_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1362461894" "Let's juice this freak!"
// BRICKSTOWN_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1080713980" "I was hoping a hero would show up!"
// BRICKSTOWN_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3088335265" "What a freak!"

